		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00092" index="92">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There is an Egg that can’t be traded\nin your party.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00093" index="93">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spin Trades is SO fun!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00094" index="94">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There!\nStop there!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00095" index="95">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My Egg go hard!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00096" index="96">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yes!\nI got the Egg I wanted!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00097" index="97">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 28, 2, 0}{PAUSE 15}\rWassup, it’s {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nWould you like to do somethin’?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00098" index="98">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whoops!\nMy bad, I gotta go do somethin’ else.\fAnother time, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wanna do\nsomethin’ else?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00100" index="100">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">... ...\nThe Hustler look busy...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00101" index="101">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00102" index="102">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">To introduce myself, I’ll show you\nmy Trainer Card.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00103" index="103">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh? Now where I put my\nTrainer Card...?\rMy bad! I’ll show you later!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00104" index="104">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We showin’ each other our\nTrainer Cards to get acquainted.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00105" index="105">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good to meet you.\nDon’t be a stranger!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00106" index="106">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna draw with me?\nBet! Just gimme a sec...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00107" index="107">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad for the wait!\nLet’s get it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00108" index="108">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, my bad!\nLet’s draw another time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00109" index="109">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: We drawin’ right\nnow.\rOh, I know! {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, would you\nlike to draw with us?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00110" index="110">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh...\nCome by anytime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00111" index="111">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK! Good looks for waitin’!\nLet’s get drawin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00112" index="112">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00113" index="113">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh!\nYou REALLY nice!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00114" index="114">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ahaha!\nWhat is THAT?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00115" index="115">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I love drawin’!\nI can draw and draw!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00116" index="116">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oops!\nI can’t stay in the lines!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00117" index="117">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A scrap? Bet, but I need\ntime to get ready.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00118" index="118">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad for the wait!\nLet’s get it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00119" index="119">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m SO sorry, but my homies\nain’t feelin’ good...\rLet’s scrap another time.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00120" index="120">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you wanna scrap, you need two\nhomies that’s Lv. 30 or lower.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00121" index="121">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That homie...\nIt been raised RIGHT!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00122" index="122">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s it!\nThat’s the right move!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00123" index="123">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s crazy!\nYou can scrap like THAT?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00124" index="124">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your timin’ on switchin’ homies\nis crazy good!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00125" index="125">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A trade? Bet, but I need\ntime to get ready.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00126" index="126">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad for the wait!\nLet’s get it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00127" index="127">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad, but I ain’t got no\nhomies I can trade right now...\rLet’s trade some other time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00128" index="128">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m tradin’ homies right now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00129" index="129">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I FINALLY got that homie I\nwanted in a trade!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00130" index="130">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can’t trade if you only got\none homie with you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00131" index="131">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you wanna do somethin’ with\nme, don’t be shy. Just ask!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00132" index="132">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna mix records?\nBet! But I need a lil time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00133" index="133">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad for the wait!\nLet’s get it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00134" index="134">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, my bad!\nLet’s do this another time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00135" index="135">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: We were just mixin’\nour records.\rI know! {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, would you like\nto mix your records with us, too?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00136" index="136">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh...\nCome by anytime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00137" index="137">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good looks for waitin’!\nLet’s mix some records!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00138" index="138">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, my bad!\nLet’s do this another time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00139" index="139">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mixin’ records is SO fun!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00140" index="140">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m finna keep mixin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00141" index="141">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s mix it up!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00142" index="142">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I wonder what’s finna happen?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00143" index="143">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spin Trade? Bet!\nOK, can you hold up a sec?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00144" index="144">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK, all ready!\nLet’s get this Spin Trade goin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00145" index="145">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00146" index="146">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you wanna join a Spin Trade, you\ngotta bring a Egg too.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00147" index="147">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: We were doing Spin Trades\njust now.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, do you wanna join us\nand do some Spin Trades, too?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00148" index="148">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, OK.\nCome see us anytime!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00149" index="149">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OK!\nLet’s do a Spin Trade together!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00150" index="150">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00151" index="151">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00152" index="152">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There is an Egg that can’t be traded\nin your party.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00153" index="153">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We doin’ Spin Trades!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00154" index="154">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wah!\nIt moved again!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00155" index="155">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There go the Egg I wanted...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00156" index="156">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it stopped there, I woulda\ngot a Berry.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00157" index="157">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Union Room.\rIf you need help with anythin’,\njust lemme know! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00158" index="158">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How can I help you? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00159" index="159">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What you want me\nto explain? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00160" index="160">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In the Union Room, you can scrap\nwith two homies of your choice\fthat’s Lv. 30 or lower.\rWhen you come through, we recommend\nbringin’ homies that\ffit that rule.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00161" index="161">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can trade your homies with\nother players.\rMeetin’ new people could be a\nshortcut to meetin’ rare homies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00162" index="162">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can link with other\nplayers and mix your records.\rWhat happen if you mix records,\nyou ask?\rWe recommend you try it and\nsee!\rUp to five players can join,\nso try it with your homies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00163" index="163">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">In a Spin Trade, everybody bring\na Egg to trade with the others.\rWhich Egg you gon’ end up with?\nWhat homie is in that Egg?\fIt’s a whole thrill!\rUp to five players can join, so\ntry it with your homies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00164" index="164">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can link up with others\nand draw.\rY’all work on one sheet\nof paper at the same time.\rA drawin’ made by homies gon’\nbe a memorable masterpiece!\rUp to five players can join,\nso try it with your homies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00165" index="165">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can chat with other people\nby pickin’ “CHAT” in the menu.\rGo out and meet other players in\nthe Union Room!\rLet people know what you like\nand what you wanna do.\rMingle, chat, and grow your\ncircle of homies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00166" index="166">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh!\nSomebody comin’ now!\rInstead of me, why not start\na chat with the new face?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00167" index="167">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00168" index="168">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">People ever mistake you for\na real {STRVAR_1 14, 0, 0}?\rI just get that vibe\nfrom you.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00169" index="169">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup!\rThat’s right!\nIt’s important to say wassup!\rIf somebody pull up, let’s try to\nbe friendly!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00170" index="170">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup!\r{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}?\nThat’s wonderful!\fI deadass like it too!\rWhen you meet somebody for the first\ntime, the proper move is to\fintroduce yourself.\rBy introducin’ yourself, you get to\nknow the other person too!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00171" index="171">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} Hustler?\nThat’s what you?\fAin’t that somethin’!\rBut I gotta say, I ain’t got\nno homies...\rI’d rather watch than scrap,\nyou see.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00172" index="172">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! Your {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}!\nI’d LOVE to have it!\fTrade me!\r...\rI was playin’.\rI ain’t got no homies, so\nI can’t trade with nobody...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00173" index="173">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}?\nI get why you’d want one...\rBut don’t expect people to\nmake trades just for you.\rYou also gotta think about what\nhomie the other person want.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00174" index="174">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Welcome to the Union Room!\rIt’s just me right now, but\nbring your homies through for\fsome fun and excitement!\rIf you got time to kill,\nI’m also here to chat.\rYou see, I got a LOT of time to\nkill...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00175" index="175">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m real good at drawin’!\rIf it’s {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0},\nleave it to me!\fNobody better than me at it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00176" index="176">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you leavin’...\r...\rThat make me feel lonely...\rCome back and visit!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00177" index="177">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s wrong?\nYou feelin’ down about somethin’?\rIf you feelin’ blue, it’s way\nbetter to have fun with homies\fthan be alone.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00178" index="178">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}?\nYes, please!\r...I wanna join in, but I’m\non the clock, so I can’t...\rSigh... {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}...\nI wish I could...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00179" index="179">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}?\nMe too, please!\rBut I gotta stay here and take\ncare of the visitors...\rEnjoy it with your homies!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00180" index="180">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}?\nYou invitin’ me?\rOh, but I gotta stay here and\ntake care of the visitors.\rMy bad. I’d love to,\nbut I deadass can’t.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00181" index="181">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s right!\rSometimes, it’s better to\njust go invite other people.\rBut don’t get too selfish or pushy\n’cause you wanna {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00182" index="182">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yes!\nIt’s OK!\rAin’t nothin’ impossible.\rThink positive and keep your\nchin up!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00183" index="183">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everybody got at least one thing\nthey ain’t good at.\rDon’t ever make somebody\ndo what they don’t wanna do.\rBy the way, {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} is\nsomethin’ I’d like to do.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00184" index="184">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good luck! Hope you enjoy\nserious scraps.\rYou can’t get scraps like\nthat in the Union Room!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00185" index="185">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna chat?\rWell, you shouldn’t be wastin’ your\ntime chattin’ with me.\rYou gotta be more active and talk\nto other players.\rAfter all, you can’t make homies\nif you don’t talk to people.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00186" index="186">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Where you at?\nUm... Right in front of me.\rOh!\nAre you maybe a impostor?\rThe real player somewhere else?\r...That’s ridiculous!\nDon’t be silly!\fMy word!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00187" index="187">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} trade?\nThat sound fun!\fI’d love to too.\rBut tellin’ me won’t help.\nI can’t trade with nobody.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00188" index="188">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If you want a {STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0}\nBattle, you gotta be more\fbold and talk to other players.\rIf you can’t speak up, you\nmight never get a shot at a\f{STRVAR_1 28, 0, 0} Battle!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0738_UNION_00189" index="189">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">INFO</language>
	</row>
